{"seq":1,"slug":"problem-formulation","title":"推荐问题建模与范式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/foundations/problem-formulation","wordCount":1657,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"推荐问题建模与范式\">推荐问题建模与范式</h1><p>「给用户推荐物品」这句话听起来只有一种含义，但落到数学上它至少分裂成四种截然不同的任务，每一种都对应不同的训练目标、不同的评估方式、甚至不同的系统架构。把任务建模错了，是推荐项目最常见也最昂贵的错误——你可能花三个月把评分预测的均方误差降了 0.1，线上点击却纹丝不动，因为业务真正要的是排序而不是分数。本篇就把这些范式一次性厘清。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>推荐的本质是一个打分与排序问题：给定用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 和候选物品集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，学习一个偏好函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}(u, i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，再据此对候选排序，取分数最高的若干个返回。不同范式的区别在于「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 预测的是什么量」以及「如何把这个量训练出来」。</p>\n<p>下图给出从原始交互数据出发，分流到四种主流建模范式的全景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[用户-物品交互日志] --&gt; B{预测目标是什么}&#10;  B --&gt;|显式分数| C[评分预测&lt;br/&gt;回归任务]&#10;  B --&gt;|相对顺序| D[Top-N 排序&lt;br/&gt;排序学习]&#10;  B --&gt;|是否点击/转化| E[CTR/CVR 预估&lt;br/&gt;二分类]&#10;  B --&gt;|下一个交互| F[序列预测&lt;br/&gt;自回归]&#10;  C --&gt; G[内积/MLP 打分]&#10;  D --&gt; H[pairwise/listwise 损失]&#10;  E --&gt; I[logloss 优化]&#10;  F --&gt; J[序列模型自回归]&#10;  G --&gt; K[排序取 Top-N 返回]&#10;  H --&gt; K&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n  A[用户-物品交互日志] --&gt; B{预测目标是什么}\n  B --&gt;|显式分数| C[评分预测&lt;br/&gt;回归任务]\n  B --&gt;|相对顺序| D[Top-N 排序&lt;br/&gt;排序学习]\n  B --&gt;|是否点击/转化| E[CTR/CVR 预估&lt;br/&gt;二分类]\n  B --&gt;|下一个交互| F[序列预测&lt;br/&gt;自回归]\n  C --&gt; G[内积/MLP 打分]\n  D --&gt; H[pairwise/listwise 损失]\n  E --&gt; I[logloss 优化]\n  F --&gt; J[序列模型自回归]\n  G --&gt; K[排序取 Top-N 返回]\n  H --&gt; K\n  I --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; K</pre><p>四种范式可以用下表对照理解，它们并非互斥，工业系统常在不同环节混用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>预测量</th>\n<th>典型损失</th>\n<th>评估指标</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>评分预测</td>\n<td>1-5 星等显式分数</td>\n<td>均方误差 RMSE</td>\n<td>RMSE、MAE</td>\n<td>早期电影评分、问卷场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Top-N 排序</td>\n<td>物品间相对偏好</td>\n<td>BPR、pairwise hinge</td>\n<td>NDCG、MAP、Recall@K</td>\n<td>隐式反馈下的列表推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CTR/CVR 预估</td>\n<td>点击/转化概率</td>\n<td>二元交叉熵 logloss</td>\n<td>AUC、logloss</td>\n<td>广告与精排环节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列预测</td>\n<td>下一个交互物品</td>\n<td>交叉熵（next-item）</td>\n<td>NDCG、HR@K</td>\n<td>短视频、电商会话推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从评分预测到-top-n-一次关键的范式迁移\">从评分预测到 Top-N：一次关键的范式迁移</h2><p>推荐研究的早期被 Netflix Prize 塑造，那是一个纯粹的评分预测竞赛：预测用户给电影打几星，用 RMSE 评判。这导致整整一代方法都在优化回归误差。但工业界很快发现一个尴尬事实——用户从不「看分数」，他们只看你排在最前面的几个。把 4.8 星预测成 4.6 星几乎无害，但把一个该排第一的物品排到第十就是灾难。</p>\n<p>这就是从评分预测到 Top-N 排序的范式迁移。Top-N 不关心绝对分数是否准确，只关心相对顺序是否正确。它的训练目标也随之改变：与其最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum (y_{ui} - \\hat{y}_{ui})^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，不如直接优化「用户交互过的物品分数高于未交互物品」这个排序关系。贝叶斯个性化排序（BPR）就是这一思想的代表，其优化目标为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max \\sum_{(u, i, j)} \\ln \\sigma(\\hat{y}_{ui} - \\hat{y}_{uj})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 是用户交互过的正样本、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 是采样的负样本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 为 sigmoid 函数。这套 pairwise 思想会在<a href=\"../classic-methods/matrix-factorization\">矩阵分解</a>一篇被完整推导。负样本如何采样、为何隐式反馈天然缺负样本，则属于<a href=\"data-feedback\">数据与显隐式反馈</a>的核心议题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ctr-预估-把推荐变成概率分类\">CTR 预估：把推荐变成概率分类</h2><p>广告与信息流场景把推荐进一步改写成一个二分类问题：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(u, i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 及大量上下文特征，预测用户点击的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>click</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\text{click} \\mid u, i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">click</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这是工业精排层最主流的范式，因为点击概率可以直接和出价、转化率相乘得到期望收益（eCPM），让推荐与商业目标精确对齐。</p>\n<p>CTR 预估用二元交叉熵（logloss）训练：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = -\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{n=1}^{N} \\big[ y_n \\ln \\hat{p}_n + (1 - y_n)\\ln(1 - \\hat{p}_n) \\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它要求模型输出的是「校准过的概率」而非任意分数——预测 0.3 就意味着这类样本真实点击率应接近 30%。这个校准性质在评分与 Top-N 范式里并不要求，却是计算广告的命脉。CTR 模型的具体结构（Wide&amp;Deep、DeepFM、DCN）是<a href=\"../deep-learning/ranking-models\">排序模型与 CTR 预估</a>的主题，本篇只确立它的问题形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"序列与生成式范式-把推荐写成-预测下一个\">序列与生成式范式：把推荐写成「预测下一个」</h2><p>近年最重要的范式转变，是把推荐重新表述为序列预测：把用户的历史交互看作一个 token 序列，模型自回归地预测「下一个最可能交互的物品」。这与语言模型预测下一个词在数学上同构，于是 NLP 的全套武器——自注意力、自回归、scaling law——都可以迁移过来。</p>\n<p>2024 年 Meta 提出的 HSTU（Hierarchical Sequential Transduction Unit）把这一范式推到极致，将推荐统一表述为生成式任务并扩展到 1.5 万亿参数，首次在大规模推荐系统中观测到类似 NLP 的 scaling law（来源：arxiv.org/abs/2402.17152，&quot;Actions Speak Louder than Words&quot;）。这标志着推荐从「为每个目标训一个判别模型」转向「用一个生成模型统一召回与排序」。该范式的模型细节属于<a href=\"../deep-learning/sequence-graph\">序列与图推荐</a>，本篇只点明它在范式版图中的位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选择范式的决策准则\">选择范式的决策准则</h2><p>面对一个新业务，如何选范式？关键看三个维度：反馈信号的形态、业务优化的真实目标、以及候选规模与延迟约束。若你只有海量隐式行为而无显式评分，评分预测基本出局；若业务核心是商业化与出价，CTR 范式几乎是唯一选择；若用户行为有强烈的时序依赖（如短视频连刷），序列范式收益最大。</p>\n<p>还要警惕「指标-目标错配」：离线优化的损失必须和你真正在乎的线上目标一致，否则会出现离线涨、线上跌的典型陷阱。这一错配的根源与排查方法，留给<a href=\"evaluation-metrics\">评估指标与离线在线评测</a>详述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>推荐不是单一任务，而是评分预测、Top-N 排序、CTR 预估、序列预测四种范式的集合，各有预测量、损失与指标。</li>\n<li>从评分预测到 Top-N 是领域的关键转折：用户只看排序，不看绝对分数，于是 pairwise/listwise 损失取代了回归误差。</li>\n<li>CTR 预估把推荐变成需要概率校准的二分类，是广告与精排的命脉，与商业目标天然对齐。</li>\n<li>序列与生成式范式把推荐重写为「预测下一个」，使 NLP 的 scaling law 第一次进入推荐，代表当前最前沿方向。</li>\n<li>选范式取决于反馈形态、业务目标与延迟约束；务必让离线损失对齐真实线上目标，避免指标-目标错配。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推荐问题建模与范式","id":"推荐问题建模与范式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从评分预测到 Top-N：一次关键的范式迁移","id":"从评分预测到-top-n-一次关键的范式迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"CTR 预估：把推荐变成概率分类","id":"ctr-预估-把推荐变成概率分类"},{"level":2,"text":"序列与生成式范式：把推荐写成「预测下一个」","id":"序列与生成式范式-把推荐写成-预测下一个"},{"level":2,"text":"选择范式的决策准则","id":"选择范式的决策准则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"数据与显隐式反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/foundations/data-feedback"}}